        "created_at": "2019-07-02T22:47:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Man, I'd forgotten asking that question. The Letters Page is always surprising! :D</p>\n<p>I really love the wacky, cheesy single-gimmick villains. Saw Man is serious bottom-of-the-barrel stuff and he's absolutely perfect.</p>\n<p>Anyone think Vicious Cycle would be a great awful villain? Goes around robbing banks and getting away on a tricked-out bicycle with like, spring-action blades and nets and gas traps and stuff. XD</p>",
